# GPC2's MODE talkback must leave RUN when its switch goes to HALT.
# Seen 2026-09-19: after a restore, HALT left the talkback reading RUN,
# because a machine held in reset kept its last outputs on the wire.
# For a restored 2-GPC vehicle (snapshot201) via ~/workspace/pass-run/synctest.sh.
wait gpc 2 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
+0     gpc 2
+5     mode HALT
wait gpc 2 mode-tb BP timeout 30
+10    mode STANDBY
+10    mode RUN
